cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite the paper below."
title: "ao_gait_phase: Adaptive Oscillator Gait Phase Estimator"
abstract: >
  Minimal real-time single-sensor adaptive-oscillator gait phase estimator
  with event-triggered phase correction. Reference implementation for the
  paper "Hybrid Adaptive Oscillator and Temporal Convolutional Network
  Estimator for Textile-Integrated Gait Phase Sensing".
